<title>THAILAND: General Finance Q3 audited net rises.</title>
<headline>General Finance Q3 audited net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the first nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 0.92			1.16</p>
<p>    Net			126.93		    187.06</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 3.76     vs	     5.09</p>
<p>    Net			520.07     vs	   504.30</p>
<p>NOTES: The company's full name is General Finance and Securities. Company previously released unaudited results for 1996 of 128.07 million baht or 0.92 a share in the quarter and 521.22 million baht or 3.76 a share in the first nine months.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
